WEBVTT

00:00:08.221 --> 00:00:10.746
[ Shouts ]

00:00:10.789 --> 00:00:13.836
[ Shouting In Minionese ]

00:00:13.879 --> 00:00:15.446
[ Whimpering ]

00:00:15.490 --> 00:00:18.231
[ Motor Roaring ]

00:00:18.275 --> 00:00:21.278
[ Babbling ]

00:00:21.321 --> 00:00:24.803
[ Screaming ]

00:00:36.119 --> 00:00:38.556
[ Sighs ]Aaah!

00:00:40.036 --> 00:00:41.559
Go!Kevin!

00:00:41.603 --> 00:00:43.387
You're mine!

00:00:46.216 --> 00:00:48.305
Yakitori!

00:00:48.348 --> 00:00:51.656
[ Laughing ]

00:00:51.700 --> 00:00:53.484
[ Minionese ]

00:00:53.528 --> 00:00:54.746
[ Laughing Continues ]

00:00:56.531 --> 00:00:58.794
- Oops.
- [ Screaming ]

00:01:01.361 --> 00:01:03.668
Oh. Hey, I got one!

00:01:05.627 --> 00:01:07.498
[ Growling ]

00:01:07.542 --> 00:01:09.979
Ah!
[ Minionese ]

00:01:10.022 --> 00:01:12.372
[ Shouting ]

00:01:13.591 --> 00:01:16.072
[ Speaks Minionese,
Laughing ]

00:01:26.517 --> 00:01:28.606
[ Sighs ][ Blowing Bubbles ]

00:01:28.650 --> 00:01:30.869
Huh? Ah.

00:01:30.913 --> 00:01:32.915
Ah. Poochie.

00:01:32.958 --> 00:01:34.525
[ Laughs ]
Huh? Huh?

00:01:34.569 --> 00:01:36.440
[ Growling ]

00:01:44.491 --> 00:01:46.581
Stuart. Bob.

00:01:46.624 --> 00:01:48.931
[ Sighs,
Speaks Minionese ]

00:01:48.974 --> 00:01:50.846
Oh, hey! Buddies!

00:01:53.544 --> 00:01:55.502
[ Recorded Voice ]
Mind the gap.

00:01:57.026 --> 00:01:58.941
Mind the gap.

00:01:58.984 --> 00:02:01.030
Mind the gap!
Mind the gap!

00:02:01.073 --> 00:02:02.553
[ Chanting ]
England! England!

00:02:02.597 --> 00:02:04.207
Mind the gap.

00:02:04.250 --> 00:02:06.122
Mind the gap!

00:02:06.165 --> 00:02:08.211
[ Whimpering ]

00:02:08.254 --> 00:02:09.865
[ Men Shouting ]

00:02:09.908 --> 00:02:11.562
[ Panting ]

00:02:15.218 --> 00:02:17.089
[ Woman Laughing ]

00:02:17.133 --> 00:02:19.309
Oh, what about
this one?

00:02:19.352 --> 00:02:22.225
Why did the queen
go to the dentist?

00:02:22.268 --> 00:02:25.097
To get her teeth crowned.

00:02:25.141 --> 00:02:26.925
[ Laughing ][ Minionese ]

00:02:26.969 --> 00:02:29.145
Tell us another one, Lizzy!

00:02:29.188 --> 00:02:31.277
Uh-- Uh-- Bello!

00:02:31.321 --> 00:02:33.323
Oh, it's you.

00:02:33.366 --> 00:02:36.326
Everyone, this is one
of the little fellows...

00:02:36.369 --> 00:02:38.763
who stole the monarchy
from me.

00:02:38.807 --> 00:02:41.200
And how's that
working out for you?

00:02:41.244 --> 00:02:43.638
Scarlet.
[ Minionese ]

00:02:43.681 --> 00:02:47.729
- Oh, yes, yes. I saw what
was going on on the telly.
- Telly?

00:02:47.772 --> 00:02:50.514
What was meant to be
the coronation
of Scarlet Overkill...

00:02:50.557 --> 00:02:52.037
has gone terribly wrong--

00:02:52.081 --> 00:02:53.691
Move!

00:02:53.735 --> 00:02:56.825
[ Growling ]
Kevin. Kevin.

00:02:56.868 --> 00:02:58.914
I know you're out there.

00:02:58.957 --> 00:03:03.092
You think you've gotten away.
Well, what do we have here?

00:03:03.135 --> 00:03:05.790
- Bello.
- Bob? Stuart?

00:03:05.834 --> 00:03:08.140
Which one
shall I kill first?

00:03:08.184 --> 00:03:11.100
Little Bob, Stuart?

00:03:11.143 --> 00:03:14.320
Bob! Stuart!
Hmm?

00:03:14.364 --> 00:03:16.192
I will do it, Kevin,

00:03:16.235 --> 00:03:19.282
if you are not
back here by dawn.

00:03:19.325 --> 00:03:21.327
- Oh, my.
- No!

00:03:21.371 --> 00:03:24.591
[ Minionese ]

00:03:28.421 --> 00:03:29.945
[ Gasping ]

00:03:29.988 --> 00:03:32.730
[ Shouting ]

00:03:32.774 --> 00:03:34.166
[ Sighs ]

00:03:39.781 --> 00:03:42.479
[ Sinister Laughing ]
There he is.

00:03:43.654 --> 00:03:45.047
[ Grunts ]

00:03:50.748 --> 00:03:52.532
Follow me!

00:03:53.882 --> 00:03:56.188
Ah! Ha-ha! Ah.

00:03:57.320 --> 00:03:59.931
Ha-ha-ha!
[ Minionese ]

00:03:59.975 --> 00:04:01.846
[ Laughing ]

00:04:01.890 --> 00:04:03.892
Oh.[ Loud Thud ]

00:04:05.458 --> 00:04:07.765
Harder! It's just my head.

00:04:07.809 --> 00:04:10.899
- [ Grunts, Spits ]
- Oh, no!

00:04:10.942 --> 00:04:13.684
This way! Look at 'em!
Go, go, go, go, go!

00:04:13.728 --> 00:04:15.468
[ Whimpering ]

00:04:15.512 --> 00:04:19.777
- [ Roaring ]
- [ Screams,
Shouting In Minionese ]

00:04:19.821 --> 00:04:22.562
- [ Roars ]
- [ Whimpering ]

00:04:24.216 --> 00:04:26.958
- Uh--
- [ Grunts ]

00:04:27.002 --> 00:04:29.700
[ Babbling ]
Huh?

00:04:29.744 --> 00:04:31.789
[ Beeping ]Ah!

00:04:31.833 --> 00:04:34.226
Oh!
[ Shouts ]

00:04:36.011 --> 00:04:37.969
[ Crying ]

00:04:38.013 --> 00:04:41.190
Oh!
[ Laughs ]
Ooh.

00:04:41.233 --> 00:04:43.758
- Huh?
- Alternate weapon initiated.

00:04:43.801 --> 00:04:46.673
[ Screaming ] Activation in three,

00:04:46.717 --> 00:04:49.589
two, one.

00:05:17.966 --> 00:05:19.489
[ Echoing ]
Bello.

00:05:19.532 --> 00:05:22.579
[ All Screaming ]

00:05:23.710 --> 00:05:25.800
Huh? Buddies.

00:05:26.801 --> 00:05:28.977
♪♪ [ Humming ]

00:05:29.020 --> 00:05:33.024
This is it, boys.
Things do not
look good for you.

00:05:33.068 --> 00:05:34.765
Oh, and I'm keeping
the bear.

00:05:34.809 --> 00:05:36.375
[ Screams ]
Tim!

00:05:36.419 --> 00:05:38.464
You're not gonna need him
where you're going.

00:05:38.508 --> 00:05:39.901
Heaven.

00:05:41.598 --> 00:05:43.818
[ Growls ]

00:05:45.297 --> 00:05:48.213
Huh? Uh--
[ Minionese ]

00:05:48.257 --> 00:05:51.086
Uh! Huh? Ah!

00:05:51.129 --> 00:05:53.436
[ Grunting ]

00:05:55.612 --> 00:05:58.267
Bye-bye.
Say bye-bye, Bob.
Bye-bye!

00:05:58.310 --> 00:06:01.444
[ Whimpers ]Ay, ay, ay, ay, ay.

